## Work blackboard

[[WORK.md]] is the shared task board for all actionable pending work.

### Read

Every agent reads [[WORK.md]] before planning or starting work.

### Write ownership

Each top-level/root agent is the sole board writer for its delegation hierarchy. Delegated workers are read-only on the board and return explicit mutations (`add`, `move`, `block`, `remove`) through their immediate parent until the root applies them.

### Root responsibilities

Root agents add newly discovered actionable work and delegated tasks before handoff, move claimed work into Active, record blockers in Blocked, and delete an entry only after completion is verified.

Every board edit must link to a durable artifact (plan, doc, source file, issue). Preserve parent links for delegated subtasks.

Re-read [[WORK.md]] immediately before each surgical edit.

### Limits

Independent root chats may still race. Re-read-before-write reduces but does not eliminate that risk. Do not duplicate board policy in bridge files; [[WORK.md]] holds format guidance.
